The derived data files in this directory (data/) and the figures in figures/
are released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

They are reductions, extracts or digitizations of third-party sources listed
in data/PROVENANCE.md; those sources retain their own terms, which must be
respected and cited when the derived files are reused.  Nothing in data/ is a
copy of a third-party database.
